 of his guests. I have not yet watched the episode, but I am told that Colbert (through his character's lens) mocked the movement (and the anti-feminist sentiments expressed within it) heavily.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T22:51:08-07:00","id":296612,"title":"","content":"There is the relevant clip over <a href=\"http://www.themarysue.com/watch-anita-sarkeesian-colbert-segment/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T05:19:32-07:00","id":296973,"title":"","content":"I was proud of his lead-in to that interview and how he refused to dignify GamerGate's origins by going into detail about the imaginary sex scandal at its heart. I haven't yet watched the interview itself, though. I really prefer Colbert's character as a one-man show; his interviews are a little embarrassing to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T11:34:36-07:00","id":297282,"title":"","content":"Wat?! This is still discussed and important?! What's wrong with this people?<br /> <br /> Correct me if I'm dead wrong, but what actually happened was:<br /> <br /> 1) A drunken dude confessed that his ex-gf slept with various game-journos.<br /> 2) Said ex-gf created a &quot;game&quot; (actually, several pages in browser with &quot;gameplay&quot; similar to some school test).<br /> 3) It seems, that after human masses didn't appreciate Zoe's masterpiece on Steam, she decided to... promote it.<br /> 4) Said promoting consisted in &quot;anonymous&quot; (penned by Zoe herself) post on some forum, where she self-attacked herself.<br /> 5) Naturally, a veritable army of &quot;paladins&quot; rose to defend her honor by clicking &quot;Like&quot; at her &quot;game&quot; page on Steam and generally providing cheap/free PR.<br /> 6) Here comes her drunken ex confession and, lo and behold - about half of valiant &quot;paladins&quot; (among whom there were a number of well known game journos) turned out to be the very same persons <i>who knew</i> [in Biblical sense] Zoe.<br /> 7) Gamer community immediately failed all Self-Control checks and Frenzied targeting... said journos.<br /> 8) Soon after that, on the most free, liberal and outspoken netsites began some paranormal activity - posts, informing all low and sundry, about a certain sell-outs... began to disappear.<br /> 9) International gaming community is rather pissed off and plan to stage anti-Zoe Maydan, with burned car-tires, trebuchets and cosplay of Medieval warriors.<br /> 10) Soon afterwards, on &quot;Depression Quest&quot; web page appeared a message, that via &quot;IFred&quot; company funds would be allocate to some charities. The thing is - &quot;iFred&quot; had no idea about all this charity buisiness, have never got the money and knew nothing about Zoe. So them duded demanded Zoe to remove any references to themselves. She complied.. only replace them with &quot;National Suicide Prvention LifeLine&quot; - with the same results.<br /> <br /> Now, please, educate me - why is this important?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","user":"von Lyttenburgh","date":". 10-30-2014, 03:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:00:59-07:00","id":297319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wat?! This is still discussed and important?! What's wrong with this people?<br /> <br /> Correct me if I'm dead wrong, but what actually happened was:<br /> <br /> 1) A drunken dude confessed that his ex-gf slept with various game-journos.<br /> 2) Said ex-gf created a &quot;game&quot; (actually, several pages in browser with &quot;gameplay&quot; similar to some school test).<br /> 3) It seems, that after human masses didn't appreciate Zoe's masterpiece on Steam, she decided to... promote it.<br /> 4) Said promoting consisted in &quot;anonymous&quot; (penned by Zoe herself) post on some forum, where she self-attacked herself.<br /> 5) Naturally, a veritable army of &quot;paladins&quot; rose to defend her honor by clicking &quot;Like&quot; at her &quot;game&quot; page on Steam and generally providing cheap/free PR.<br /> 6) Here comes her drunken ex confession and, lo and behold - about half of valiant &quot;paladins&quot; (among whom there were a number of well known game journos) turned out to be the very same persons that <i>knew</i> [in Biblical sense] Zoe.<br /> 7) Gamer community immediately failed all Self-Control checks and Frenzied targeting... said journos.<br /> 8) Soon after that, on the most free, liberal and outspoken netsites began some paranormal activity - posts, informing all low and sundry, about a certain sell-outs... began to disappear.<br /> 9) International gaming community is rather pissed off and plan to stage anti-Zoe Maydan, with burned car-tires, trebuchets and cosplay of Medieval warriors.<br /> <br /> Now, please, educate me - why is this important?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you just answered your own question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:16:05-07:00","id":297335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297319#post297319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think you just answered your own question.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Huh? Where?<br /> <br /> BTW, since I first heard about it in early September I didn't pay any attention to all that jazz.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","user":"von Lyttenburgh","date":". 10-30-2014, 03:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:31:29-07:00","id":297362,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Correct me if I'm dead wrong, but what actually happened was:<br /> <br /> 1) A drunken dude confessed that his ex-girlfriend slept with various games journalists.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not aware of any proof that this ever happened.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2) Said ex-girlfriend created a &quot;game&quot; (actually, several pages in browser with &quot;game play&quot; similar to some school test).</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a game in the style of visual novels, which I personally don't care for but which do have an audience. She also created the games prior to the alleged unfaithfulness to her then-boyfriend.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) It seems, that after human masses didn't appreciate Zoe's masterpiece on Steam, she decided to... promote it.<br /> 4) Said promoting consisted in &quot;anonymous&quot; (penned by Zoe herself) post on some forum, where she self-attacked herself.<br /> 5) Naturally, a veritable army of &quot;paladins&quot; rose to defend her honor by clicking &quot;Like&quot; at her &quot;game&quot; page on Steam and generally providing cheap/free PR.<br /> 6) Here comes her drunken ex confession and, lo and behold - about half of valiant &quot;paladins&quot; (among whom there were a number of well known game journos) turned out to be the very same persons that <i>knew</i> [in Biblical sense] Zoe.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am unaware of any proof that these things ever happened.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">7) Gamer community immediately failed all Self-Control checks and Frenzied targeting...said journalists.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have never seen anyone call out or condemn any of the journalists; I can rarely even find someone who can name three of the five alleged whores in this case. The attacks I have seen have been leveled exclusively at Ms. Quinn.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">8) Soon after that, on the most free, liberal and outspoken netsites began some paranormal activity - posts, informing all low and sundry, about a certain sell-outs... began to disappear.<br /> 9) International gaming community is rather pissed off and plan to stage anti-Zoe Maydan, with burned car-tires, trebuchets and cosplay of Medieval warriors.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not understand what these sentences mean.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">10) Soon afterwards, on &quot;Depression Quest&quot; web page appeared a message, that via &quot;IFred&quot; company funds would be allocate to some charities. The thing is - &quot;iFred&quot; had no idea about all this charity business, have never got the money and knew nothing about Zoe. So those dudes demanded Zoe remove any references to themselves. She complied...only replace them with &quot;National Suicide Prevention LifeLine,&quot; with the same results.</div> </div> </div> </div>To the best of my awareness, charitable donations were made, though not as swiftly as her accusers would have liked.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297282#post297282\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, please, educate me: Why is this important?</div> </div> </div> </div>Important to whom? I think it's important because real people are having their safety threatened over the fear that girls will play video games and give &quot;real&quot; gamers cooties, because when it comes to the priorities of a lot of people involved, a human being's right to breathe air without having her life threatened is being prioritized lower than an amorphous social construct's privilege to erect a NO GIRLS ALLOWED sign outside the clubhouse based around imaginary plumbers jumping on imaginary turtles. That's fucked up, and it needs to be exposed to daylight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":". 10-30-2014, 04:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T12:37:03-07:00","id":297367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>von Lyttenburgh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297335#post297335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh? Where?<br /> <br /> BTW, since I first heard about it in early September I didn't pay any attention to all this jazz.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's important because it highlights thing that certain parts of the hardcore gamer community conceives of as important, and to what lengths they're willing to go in order to protect it.<br /> <br /> For example, referring back to your own description above, in point 2 you question Depression Quest's status as a &quot;game&quot;. This expansion of the gaming medium, where games are starting to look radically different than they previously have, is a thorn in the side of some who are very comfortable with things as they are.<br /> <br /> Furthermore, in your description of the sequence of events, you solely describe events with a focus on Zoey Quinn. While I understand that you've not been up to date on events, I've talked previously about the blatantly misogynist rhetoric of attacking Quinn for sleeping with someone for a review when it would be equally, if not more, prudent to accuse the one who actually wrote the piece for sleeping with someone he was about to assess (not to mention that it has been proven that none of this actually happened; Grayson did not write any reviews on Quinn's game). The very common pattern in sexual relations of saddling the woman with all the responsibility of an inherently mutual act (in this case two - both sex and a business trade) is obvious. Now, I'm not saying you're misogynist, but it should be a telltale sign that the things someone uninformed has managed to pick up through osmosis are just these things.<br /> <br /> However, what I believe Papa Bear is saying is that in point 9, you state that &quot;International gaming community is rather pissed off and plan to stage anti-Zoe Maydan, with burned car-tires, trebuchets and cosplay of Medieval warriors.&quot; It does, indeed, seem to be pretty damn important if people get so up in arms about it. And that importance might sometimes be hard to see, because it's very much a matter of cultural conservatism. It I the fear of a development of the games medium, in which non-traditional forms and groups take a bigger space at the perceived cost of the traditional ones, that cause this kind of uproar.<br /> <br /> And, to be honest, whether the GamerGate people actually believe in their front or not, the discussion of ethics in video game journalism is an important one to have.<br /> <br /> Even if you don't think this is an important thing, and I can kind of understand if you don't, all of this is steeped in harassment and &quot;doxxing&quot;, that is the posting of crucial &quot;docs&quot; or &quot;documents&quot; such as physical address and other personal information online. Even if we disregard the subject of the controversy, the means of it leaves it uncondonable. It's true that harassment happens everyday on the internet, but I don't think that makes it unimportant; at most, maybe, too massive a problem to meaningfully grapple with. Harassment also goes on in our culture at large, particularly of women. If nothing else, this is a way of highlighting and spreading knowledge of this fact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 10-30-2014, 03:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T13:08:56-07:00","id":297420,"title":"","content":"By the way, does anyone have a video of the first part of the Colbert Report thing that can be accessed from the UK? The link in the thread seems to be America only.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fix2Bi0FShY\" target=\"_blank\">Ah wait, nevermind, I found one.</a><br /> <br /> Is it only me or did he purposefully not let Sarkeesian develop her arguments? That might just be his interview style, I suppose. I thought Sarkeesian could have been a bit more relenting in her rejection of the &quot;ethics in games journalism&quot; rhetoric, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 10-30-2014, 04:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T13:28:51-07:00","id":297435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=294031#post294031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Beyond that, social justice seems like a great idea; why would we not want that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly because it's associated with people who are perpetually offended over everything and assume if you're a person who's white, has testicles, and happens to like have sexual encounters with women exclusively, then your opinion means nothing and you should sit in a corner and think about all that juicy privilege you have.<br /> <br /> It tends to be associated with radfems, misandry, Other-kin being offended that no one accepts them, etc.<br /> <br /> Tactics are very &quot;aggressively passive&quot; which usually is seeing themselves up as martyrs on the net and if you dare bring up criticism to them, you are given the label of misogynist, effectively trying to shut down the conversation before it can continue.<br /> <br /> In short, most people view them as an annoyance and people hating on a socially acceptable group to hate (white straight men) than actually trying to promote social justice. Hence why the label of &quot;SJW&quot; is used sarcastically.<br /> <br /> As for GG in general, I don't really have an opinion on it one way or the other. I've mostly seen the pieces as follows:<br /> <br /> 1. Crazy ass conspiracy comes out of drunk boyfriend. Lot of people follow it.<br /> 2. Games media comes out saying &quot;Gamers are dead.&quot;, which apparently got translated to saying that white male gamers shouldn't be catered to anymore as a demographic. much butthurt ensued.<br /> 3. 4chan's /b/ does what /b/ does and raids tumblr, posting pictures of dead bodies into a lot of people's feeds. rumors flying that someone in high society's daughter tried to kill herself over it and moot gets a call from someone to stop it.<br /> 4. meanwhile, /v/, /pol/, and /co/ are going ballistic and heavy censorship ensues by mods, enraging them further.<br /> 5. They scamper off to various other chans and boards, fighting with SJWs over twitter, form posts, and the like and regroup.<br /> <br /> So now you have two groups going at each other's throats and it's very clear that neither is going away anytime soon. Might as well sit back and grab the popcorn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":604,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","user":"Shock","date":". 10-30-2014, 04:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T13:53:06-07:00","id":297462,"title":"","content":"With a risk to my life and sanity I tried to catch up with all this &quot;Gamer Gate&quot; scandal. I only scraped the surface 'cause, I'm afraid, all his mess can give me a cancer.<br /> <br /> I've been playing (okay - at first just watching my elder brothers playing) PC games since 1992. I still have on my comp some of the newest games released just this year (it is &quot;Golden Wake&quot; and &quot;Quest for Infamy&quot;... which kinda tells a lot about my preferences). But, apparently, I'm not a &quot;gamer&quot;, like belonging to &quot;gaming community&quot;. I do not spend month wages on games, I do not own XBox or PS3 (I don't even have a &quot;Guitar Hero&quot; - I'm perfectly okay with my normal acoustic guitar). I don't play MMORPGs. So, naturally, all this shitstorm looks for me quite unnatural. I mean, what - these people don't have a real life?<br /> <br /> OTOH - what a stupid question!<br /> <br /> For me - both sides are just sick. Anti-Zoe troglodytes for issuing threats (anyone doing this is sick IMO) and Pro-Zoe apologists for all their hysterics and drama. As the Bard said: &quot;<i>A plague on both your houses</i>&quot;.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3479,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","user":"von Lyttenburgh","date":". 10-30-2014, 08:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3479-von-lyttenburgh","name":"von Lyttenburgh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3479_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T14:21:58-07:00","id":297502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I do not own XBox or PS3 </div> </div> </div>&quot;Gamers&quot; and PC Gaming Master Race are different things, then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T16:17:50-07:00","id":297579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297435#post297435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mostly because it's associated with people who are perpetually offended over everything and assume if you're a person who's white, has testicles, and happens to like have sexual encounters with women exclusively, then your opinion means nothing and you should sit in a corner and think about all that juicy privilege you have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sometimes it's better for people to be quiet, listen, and learn about others' struggles than it is for them to express opinions on things they have never personally experienced or suffered through.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shock</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297435#post297435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It tends to be associated with radfems, misandry, Other-kin being offended that no one accepts them, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dismissive assumptions like this don't even merit a real response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T17:44:43-07:00","id":297644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297579#post297579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sometimes it's better for people to be quiet, listen, and learn about others' struggles than it is for them to express opinions on things they have never personally experienced or suffered through.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, they should. Problem is thought is that's typically a byword for &quot;Shut the hell up because my victimhood is bigger than yours.&quot; in which each party tries to make the other fill more guilt and shame more than the Catholic Church and ends up as a very petty, passive aggressive of who can be offended more.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297579#post297579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dismissive assumptions like this don't even merit a real response.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mostly because the post is a caricature of a typical SJW and aren't representative of people who are actually attempting social good but rather use just such a cause to beat another group over the head. I'm sorry you feel that way but that's how the internet has currently defines them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T18:17:54-07:00","id":297657,"title":"","content":"After reading this thread and related links, it seems that the answer to the question (the thread titled) is a bunch of video geeks-guys got their panties in a wad about video geek-chicks joining the club. To the point where they decided to issue threats...(pfft...real manly...) One of said &quot;guys&quot; decides to talk crap about his ex...(real class act there)<br /> <br /> Does that sum it up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-30T19:13:14-07:00","id":297705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/293843-so-just-what-is-gamergate-anyway?p=297657#post297657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does that sum it up?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is my understanding of the facts. There are others, but since I don't believe them, I feel it would be bad faith for me to present them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_