nd behold - about half of valiant &quot;paladins&quot; (among whom there were a number of well known game journos) turned out to be the very same persons <i>who knew</i> [in Biblical sense] Zoe.<br /> 7) Gamer community immediately failed all Self-Control checks and Frenzied targeting... said journos.<br /> 8) Soon after that, on the most free, liberal and outspoken netsites began some paranormal activity - posts, informing all low and sundry, about a certain sell-outs... began to disappear.<br /> 9) International gaming community is rather pissed off and plan to stage anti-Zoe Maydan, with burned car-tires, trebuchets and cosplay of Medieval warriors.<br /> 10) Soon afterwards, on &quot;Depression Quest&quot; web page appeared a message, that via &quot;IFred&quot; company funds would be allocate to some charities. The thing is - &quot;iFred&quot; had no idea about all this charity buisiness, have never got the money and knew nothing about Zoe. So them duded demanded Zoe to remove any references to themselves. She complied.. only replace them with &quot;National Suicide Prvention LifeLine&quot; - with the same results.<br /> <br /> Now, please, educate me - why is this important?</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">The accusation's against Quinn contained in this post have been repeatedly refuted, please don't continue to spread false information.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a hre